@startuml 09-google-oauth
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #888
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

title [09] Đăng Nhập Google OAuth (Khách Du Lịch)

actor "Khách du lịch" as User
participant "StorePage / bất kỳ page\nyêu cầu đăng nhập" as Page
participant "auth-google.ts\nlib/api/auth-google.ts" as AuthLib
participant "customer-session.ts\nlib/auth/customer-session.ts" as Session
cloud "Google OAuth\n(accounts.google.com)" as Google
participant "AuthController\nbackend/src/auth/auth.controller.ts" as Ctrl
participant "GoogleAuthGuard\nbackend/src/auth/guards/google-auth.guard.ts" as Guard
participant "GoogleStrategy\nbackend/src/auth/strategies/google.strategy.ts" as Strategy
participant "AuthService\nbackend/src/auth/auth.service.ts" as Svc
database "Postgres\n(customer_google_accounts)" as DB
participant "AuthCallbackClient\napp/(auth)/auth/callback/AuthCallbackClient.tsx" as Callback

== 1. User nhấn "Đăng nhập Google" ==

User -> Page : click "Đăng nhập với Google"
Page -> AuthLib : redirectToGoogleOAuth(returnUrl)
AuthLib -> Session : saveReturnUrl(returnUrl)\n(lưu vào localStorage)
AuthLib -> AuthLib : window.location.href =\n'{BACKEND_URL}/api/auth/google'

== 2. Backend redirect sang Google ==

AuthLib -> Ctrl : GET /auth/google
Ctrl -> Guard : GoogleAuthGuard (Passport)
Guard -> Google : redirect tới Google OAuth consent screen
Google --> User : Hiện trang đăng nhập Google

User -> Google : chọn tài khoản Google + đồng ý
Google -> Strategy : callback → GET /auth/google/callback
Strategy -> Svc : findOrCreateCustomer(googleProfile)
Svc -> DB : SELECT customer WHERE googleId = ?\n(nếu chưa có → INSERT mới)
DB --> Svc : CustomerGoogleAccount
Svc --> Strategy : customer

== 3. Backend issue JWT và redirect về frontend ==

Strategy --> Ctrl : req.user = customer
Ctrl -> Ctrl : authService.issueCustomerJwt(customer)\n→ JWT token (payload: id, displayName, avatarUrl)
Ctrl -> Ctrl : res.redirect(\n  '{FRONTEND_URL}/auth/callback?token={jwt}'\n)

== 4. Frontend nhận token và lưu session ==

Ctrl --> Callback : redirect /auth/callback?token={jwt}
Callback -> Callback : lấy token từ URL params
Callback -> Session : saveCustomerToken(token)\n(lưu vào localStorage)
Callback -> Callback : fetchCurrentCustomer(token)\n→ GET /auth/me (verify token)
Callback -> Ctrl : GET /auth/me\n(Header: Authorization: Bearer {token})
Ctrl -> Ctrl : CustomerJwtGuard → validate JWT
Ctrl --> Callback : { id, displayName, avatarUrl }
Callback -> Session : getReturnUrl() → lấy URL trước đó
Callback -> Callback : router.push(returnUrl)
Callback --> User : Đăng nhập thành công\nChuyển về trang trước

@enduml
